{"subject":"Do not submit claim C018986: duplicate of C021748","body":"Hi billing lead,

Please do not submit claim C018986 (patient PT0153, service T1019, date of service 2026-10-12, billed $85.40, 14 units). It duplicates claim C021748, which has already been billed and paid or is predicted to be paid. Same member, service and date of service were already submitted under C021748. Editing this claim will not fix it, so it should be held and not sent to Northwind Health Plan.

Please confirm once you have removed C018986 from the submission queue. The planned submission date is 2026-11-02, so please confirm before then."}
